      {
        "id": "def-density-target-and-kernel-density-estimator",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "Density targets and the kernel density estimator",
        "statement": "For a Borel probability density version f on R^d and iid X_1,...,X_n with law f dλ_d, define the pointwise target ψ_x(f)=f(x) and, for a Borel K∈L^1(R^d) with ∫K=1 and h>0, the indexed estimator fhat_h(x)=(nh^d)^−1 Σ_i K((x−X_i)/h). Pointwise targets depend on the selected density version; no law-identifiability is asserted without regularity.",
